00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:21.902
We wanted to deal with children
because it's more difficult to

00:03:21.902 --> 00:03:24.482
deal with adults because

00:03:24.482 --> 00:03:29.042
their resources are not as attractive

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:34.275
and children we knew that you
could help them and if you miss

00:03:34.275 --> 00:03:37.470
all that helping as an adult
you're losing and all awful lot.

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:41.130
We wanted to start with people
that we could help like my

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:44.974
grandson who is the reason why,
he's 14 years old by the way,

00:03:44.974 --> 00:03:47.862
he's not going to be
working for Google anytime soon.

00:03:47.862 --> 00:03:50.422
