don't know what he'll do.

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:05.545
He doesn't communicate and give
you the signals as to what his

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:06.713
next idea is going to be.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:10.582
It's that sort of thing.

00:04:10.582 --> 00:04:14.821
Anyway, we did all this and then
we looked at three organizations

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:17.457
