that has business experience

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.776
should not forget that
business experience going

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:11.278
into a not-for-profit.

00:05:11.278 --> 00:05:14.681
You build up skills and you
build up ability to manage

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:17.083
people or deal with people 
you don't lose that because

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:17.817
