00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.152
- It's one of my
biggest arguments.

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:22.389
I yell it to my audience and a
lot of people in startup culture

00:05:22.389 --> 00:05:25.556
that so many venture capitalists
even of they've built business

00:05:25.556 --> 00:05:28.128
she or he has built a business
in the past they start giving

00:05:28.128 --> 00:05:31.531
advice to these startups that
are more predicated on raising

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:33.580
