Yes, I did.

00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:14.174
I was on Long Island.

00:06:14.174 --> 00:06:16.176
- There for all the good stuff.
- Jets Jets Jets.

00:06:16.176 --> 00:06:17.811
- This is getting
better by the second.

00:06:17.811 --> 00:06:20.138
Keep going.

00:06:20.138 --> 00:06:23.917
- My goal in life I want to be
Edward Bennett Williams which at

00:06:23.917 --> 00:06:29.089
