00:09:33.573 --> 00:09:35.675
Listen, the market is
the market is a market.

00:09:35.675 --> 00:09:37.510
They don't care
about your headaches.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.845
It is what it is.

00:09:38.845 --> 00:09:42.415
